<figure class="diagram-figure">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 640 360" role="img" aria-labelledby="dot-diagram-title dot-diagram-desc">
    <title id="dot-diagram-title">Sudut antara dua vektor</title>
    <desc id="dot-diagram-desc">
      Vektor a dan b berbagi titik awal. Sudut theta di antara keduanya berhubungan dengan
      perkalian titik melalui kosinus.
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <pattern id="dot-grid" width="32" height="32" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
        <path d="M32 0H0V32" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-grid)" stroke-width="1" />
      </pattern>
      <marker id="dot-arrow-a" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M0 0 10 5 0 10z" fill="var(--color-vector-a)" />
      </marker>
      <marker id="dot-arrow-b" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M0 0 10 5 0 10z" fill="var(--color-vector-b)" />
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <rect width="640" height="360" fill="url(#dot-grid)" rx="12" />
    <line x1="90" y1="300" x2="560" y2="300" stroke="var(--color-axis)" stroke-width="1.5" />
    <line x1="90" y1="300" x2="90" y2="60" stroke="var(--color-axis)" stroke-width="1.5" />

    <line x1="90" y1="300" x2="480" y2="300" stroke="var(--color-vector-a)" stroke-width="3" marker-end="url(#dot-arrow-a)" />
    <line x1="90" y1="300" x2="340" y2="125" stroke="var(--color-vector-b)" stroke-width="3" marker-end="url(#dot-arrow-b)" />

    <path d="M190 300a100 100 0 0 0 70 -47" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-text-secondary)" stroke-width="1.5" />
    <circle cx="90" cy="300" r="4.5" fill="var(--color-primary)" />

    <text x="185" y="275" class="diagram-axis">θ</text>
    <text x="285" y="296" class="diagram-label diagram-label--a">a</text>
    <text x="220" y="180" class="diagram-label diagram-label--b">b</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>
    Sudut θ memenuhi cos θ = (a · b) / (‖a‖ ‖b‖). Nilai kosinus menunjukkan apakah sudut lancip,
    siku-siku, atau tumpul.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
